guide workflows/scripted-workflows, guide tool-reference/retained-children, guide tool-reference/external-cli-agent-profiles.\\n\\nSAFETY-CRITICAL SUBAGENT GUIDANCE:\\n- Delegate only when the operator asked, directly or through applicable user/project instructions; size, complexity or risk alone is not authorization.\\n- Native async completion wakes this session: return control; do not sleep, poll or call bg_wait for it.\\n- One writer per cwd/worktree; isolate concurrent writers.\\n- After a launch or runtime failure, stop and report it; never silently switch to interactive_shell, pi -ne or another CLI.\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"agent\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"One-child agent or management target.\"},\"task\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"One-child task; requires agent.\"},\"workflow\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"boolean\"},{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1}],\"description\":\"true: run the one ```js workflow block written in this same reply (false invalid). String with '/': script file read from request cwd. Other string: named workflow resource. Raw scripts (true or path) have no runs.host.\"},\"args\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"maxProperties\":16,\"additionalProperties\":true,\"description\":\"Plain-JSON args for workflow; 16 fields/object, 64 items/array, depth 8, 16 KiB total; raw-script args are exposed deeply frozen and persisted, so do not include secrets.\"},\"async\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",\"description\":\"Background; default asyncByDefault. false only to block parent.\"},\"model\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Child model provider/id; bare id only if unique. Suffix :off/minimal/low/medium/high/xhigh/max overrides agent thinking default.\"},\"cwd\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Execution/project-pane directory.\"},\"worktree\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",\"description\":\"Isolate each workflow child in a managed git worktree; child worktree:false overrides default.\"},\"output\":{\"anyOf\":[{\